==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>, delay 6.67~23.33 seconds<sup>200f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**25 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**40 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**20 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam the living daylights out of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]. The Doge Dark spam here is immense, with there being 10+ on screen at once, but a good stack of Paris Cats can clear them out while outranging The Face at the same time.

